---
import Button from "../ui/Button.astro";
---

<section class="py-16 md:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl">
          <img
            src="/placeholder.jpg"
            alt="Kapadia High School Students"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 w-32 h-32 bg-gold-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-navy-500 mb-4">About Our School</h2>
        <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold-500 rounded-full mb-6" />
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading font-semibold text-navy-600 mb-4">Excellence in Education Since 1956</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          Kapadia High School was founded in 1956, starting with a modest group of students eager to learn. Over the years, our institution has grown into a vibrant educational center, nurturing a diverse array of students who shine brightly both locally and internationally.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Situated in the heart of the community, Kapadia High School is a co-educational English medium school dedicated to fostering academic excellence and personal growth in a supportive environment.
        </p>
        <Button variant="primary" href="/about">
          Learn More
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
          </svg>
        </Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
